B.c3q=new A.fc(B.iI,"Accurate Study Privileges & Facilities","The Perks and Environment sections now reflect only the genuine facilities provided by your library. Air Conditioning and extra perks only appear if actually equipped.","Real Perks","shield","/student/home","Explore Facilities")
